t adjustment no deviation survives. On the driver's traffic position: no external traffic cause was asserted, the bundle's traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-00108-01 is MISSING (weight 0.0), and POL-RD-13 is not engaged; the driver invoked no exculpatory clause against a cited artifact, so no POL-RD-10(5) escalation arises. On POL-RD-04: every chat message carries waypoint_hint null and no road is named, so its 200 m corroboration test cannot be run; the clause is simply unavailable, and it is not needed, because POL-RD-05 already resolves the baseline. On the repeat-deviation check: with no deviation established and no material deviation on this trip, POL-RD-06 is not triggered; in any event driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 0 against completed_trips_90d of 402, far below both the 3-flag and 5% tests. The driver's mention in passing of the lifetime prior_deviation_flags counter is not a ground of decision — POL-GEN-01 makes that field context only, and POL-RD-06 asks for the trailing-90-day figure, which is what the claim actually used. No escalation trigger under POL-RD-10 fires: all three artifacts carry TRP-00108, the trace is unimpaired (206 fixes, 100% coverage, no gaps, max_gap_sec 0.0), the POL-RD-05 re-quote is present and non-null, no fare line lacks a counterpart, and no refund amount is in issue. Confidence is capped at 1.0, the weight of the two artifacts carrying the deciding facts (EV-GPS-00108 trace and EV-TRIP-00108 amended re-quote, both at weight_multiplier 1.0), and I set it at 0.9. The metered charge of SGD 33.77 stands and no money moves.",
